--- !u!114 &53863222
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 53863220}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Ahhh nooo it happened again! I keep forgetting to write, I'm such a bad
    historian\u2026 How's anyone going to be able to use this in the future if I
    keep going months between? (It's really not that serious ktk)\n\n\nI made a new
    friend! His name is ayvczmli and he's in one of my classes. He and my other friends
    have been getting along pretty well so far, and the plan is to have a big hang
    out soon with the whole group. I'm really excited, it's been so long since everyone
    has been able to hang out as a group. Too bad Ethan and his sister can't come
    though, they've been pretty radio silent recently. I've heard that apparently
    there's supposed to be a big Halloween party next Saturday, maybe I should see
    if we want to hang out there. Haven't been to a party in a while, and Halloween
    is one of my favorite holidays after all\u2026\n\n\nNothing has really changed
    in regards to classes, though I have been getting better at not putting things
    off so that I end up staying up so late at nights haha\n\n\nThis one is a pretty
    short one, I don't have much to report this time mw. The computer issues haven't
    been very noticeable, I really don't know what's up with the saving issues. If
    it happens again, I might want to take it to get repaired or something, we'll
    have to see.\n\n\nCasey Wakefield, signing off :}\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
