      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "I\u2026 Something is wrong. The party got really chaotic so I had to go
    away from the main area to get Some air. A few of the Others came with me, but
    I didn't see them after a wHile. I don't know where they went, but I shoulD probably
    check up on them in the morning. I hope Regan and Sofia are on their way home.
    I didn't see them at the party when I was leaVing, but tHey didn't Kome out with
    me.\n\n\nGod, I can't sHake the feeling that something has gone horribly wrong.
    Maybe I just need tO go to Sleep."
