--- !u!114 &228909296
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 228909294}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It was there again.\n\n\nqndbfh it's still there.\n\n\nI saw it this time.\n\n\nFrom
    a distance, it almost looked like another person, albeit a bit taller than normal.
    The closer I got, the more It seemed to\u2026 shift. Limbs growing longer and
    longer the more I looked, features that seemed to morph and shift around on the
    face\u2014\u2014never staying in one place. I swear I could see something underneath
    the skin, wriggling and pushing against it, as if it was about to come bursting
    out.\n\n\nI don't think it saw me, but it definitely heard me. Its head seemed
    to snap towards eVen the smallest noise, as if it was as loud as an explosion.
    The movement looked like it would be excruciatingly painful to anything else\u2014\u2014accompanied
    by the sound of breaking bones each time\u2014\u2014but this thing was completely
    unBothered. It didn't move like anything I had ever seen before.\n\n\nI\u2026
    I don't know wHat to do.\n\n\nWhat was that thinG?\n\n\nWhat do I do about something
    like that? Can I even do anything?\n\n\nI can't get anyone else involved.\n\n\nGod,
    Who would even believe me? If I hadn't seen it myself, I wouldn't believe it
    either.\n\n\nI still feel Watched, have ever since I went there the first time.
    \n\n\nI couldn't find anything related to the others."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
