--- !u!114 &677674548
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 677674546}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Oh wow it's been a lot longer than I meant to be gone. Things have been
    super hectic lately. Classwork has been picking up steam quite a bit, so I basically
    have a ton of homework every sIngle night. When I'm not working on my degree,
    I've been busy with social-related things, like helping with emotional issues
    and other things. It's just been so busy lately that I haven't been able to do
    much else haha, but I'm hOpefully back now.\n\n\nMy classes have been going greaT
    so far! I'm really liking the subject matter, and while a few of them started
    out painfully slow, they've really been getting more and more interesting the
    longer they go on. The teachers aren't any better unfortunately :[ Still as boring
    as ever.\n\n\nLife has been gOing good for the most part, but I just can't seem
    to shake the feeling that something is missing? I don't know how to explain it
    exactly, it's like there's supposed to be something or someone there, but just
    isn't for some reason. I know I'm missing something but I can't for the life
    of me figure out just what it is\u2026 Maybe I just need more sleep.\n\n\nThe
    homEsickness hasn't really lessened at all. I'm not even that far away from home,
    but with everything going on, I still can't find the time to go back, even on
    the weekends. The weirdness of being away from the place I spent the majority
    of my life in just refuses to lessen at all. That's not even mentioning missing
    my friends from back home. We've been talking for a while online, but it's just
    not the same, you know?\n\n\nEthan still isn't responding. There has been absolutely
    nothing from him for months now. Why has no one else noticed? I can't even get
    in contact with his parents. Every time I try, it just goes to voicemail, and
    they haven't called me back since before school started. Every time I try to
    ask our friends about it, they either brush me off or act like they didn't hear
    me. They're acting like he doesn't exist and I just want to know what's going
    on for once.\n\n\nI haveN't been able to go outside much lately and I miss it
    :[\n\n\nSome fresh air would do me Good, as wound up as I've been the past little
    while, but I just don't have the time T^T\n\n\nI think things are finally calMing
    down a bit, so maybe I could see if the others wanted to go for a picnic or something
    soon? All three of us could definitely use a break.\n\n\nAnyways, its like\u2026
    2 am right now and I'm still not tired so I should probably turn this off, \"reduce
    my blue light before sleeping\" or whAtever.\n\n\nCasey Wakefield, signing Off
    :}\n\n\n\n\n\nIt happened again. Checked this entry after I wOke up, and I swear
    something is gone. There's gaps in sentences Where I wouldn't put them, there's
    an entire paragraph gone again that I swear I wrote\u2026 What did I write exactly?
    This is just so weird :/ I can't find anyThing online that describes anything
    like this, but I don't have the time to do anything about it. This is so frustrating,
    I hate not knowing wHat's going on like this.\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
