  m_text: 'They''re still not home.



    It''s been hours.



    I''ve been trying
    to get a hold of them but they aren''t responding. No one who came OUTSIDE with
    me is.



    I''m going back to the forest after I shower. Maybe I can find
    some information about where the others ended up.'
