--- !u!114 &1170752127
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1170752125}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Wow, this feels weird. I'd gotten so uSed to the old hunk of garbage I
    called my olD laptop that I forgot how computers are actually supposed to be\u2026
    The sound these keys make are so nice to listen to, I almost don't want to stop!
    I ended up losing most of my journal when transferring files, which is super
    annoying :[\n\n\nMight as well start oVer at this point. Figure that when historians
    in the future are trying to figure out what life was like in the 21st century,
    they need someone to have written down eVerything, so why not me?\n\n\n(Gray
    tells me that putting it down in a digital space wouldn't really do anything
    but ehhhhh, I lose my notebooks so easily that it's just better if I write it
    on here so I don't lose it. Maybe I can transfer the entries at some point when
    I can keep better track of things.)\n\n\nANYWAYS.\n\n\nThe first day of classes
    is in a few days, but I've already moved into my dorm room. I'm pretty lucky
    that I ended up roommates with Regan but I can't wait to get to know the others
    as well, since it's just been the two of us for the past few days. I wonder what's
    taking them so long? The deadline to move in is only in a few days.\n\n\nMy room
    has a pretty nice view out the window, which is nice. I was a little worried
    about that. Natural and/or led light over the big light every time, so I love
    that I'll have something nice to look at when I'm working on homework. I'll have
    to see if anyone want to go explore around the forest I can see from where I'm
    sitting. It's definitely going to be so pretty when fall comes, all the pretty
    colors painting the trees ^-^\n\n\nI'm excited for classes, don't get me wrong,
    but I'm worried about not liking my teachers or classmates, or even the classwork
    in general\u2026 It's just, I've heard so much in my life about how \"college
    is way different from high school\" and \"everything is so much harder\" and
    all those kind of things and part of me doesn't want things to change too much.
    I'm also worried that I'm going to make some kind of mistake because I made a
    decision or spoke before I could fully think things through and I end up doing/saying
    something that ruins a relationship or messes with my chances of doing what I
    want to do. It's a never-ending problem, but I really really want it to not happen
    this time if I can help it.\n\n\nIt's going to be an adjustment that's for sure.
    I'm a bit worried about my choice in major not having as many opportunities as
    say, Pre-Med or Computer Science like some of the others are doing. Yeah, I've
    wanted to do something with history since I was little, but at this point I don't
    know if I want to prioritiZe my happiness oR money\u2026\n\n\nThat's enough reflecting
    for now, Ugh. Hate when I accidentally get too far into my head.\n\n\nMaybe Regan
    will be willing to play a game with me\u2026 I think I set up the console, but
    I'll have to see.\n\n\nCasey Wakefield, siGning off ;}\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
