  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'The Qarty is in a Few hours, I''m suPer excited! Sofia has been helping
    me with my costume these past few days, she''s actually really Good at sewing
    and diy Projects. It''ll be good to actually hang out with the others for the
    first time in a while. I heard there''s a really cool looking forest behind where
    the party''s being held, maybe I can get some of the others to come with me to
    look arouNd ;}



    Halloween is such a fun holiday, I love dreZsing Up however
    I want and not having to worry about being judged for it. And the history behind
    it is so interesting as well!



    OopZ, that''s Sofia calling me, gotta go!



    Casey
    Wakefield, signing off :}


'
