  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'I couldn''t find anY sign of them. It''s like they disappeared from existence.



    THere''s
    something strange about that place. I couldn''t shake the feeling that I waS
    being watched the entire time I was there. And it didn''t feel like some Xind
    of animal, it felt like someone was there. Like whatever it was knew why I was
    there and what I was looking for.



    Whenever I turned arounB though, there
    was nothing.



    In fact, thEre was nothing the entire time K was there, the
    only sound being the wind blowing through the leaves and mY own breathing. I
    didn''t see a single animal at any point.



    I don''t know wHat''s going
    on.



    Why haven''t Regan and Sofia beXn answering my calls? It''s not like
    either of them to be out for so long, especially without talking to me first.



    God,
    I hope things wiLl go back to normal when the weekend is oveR.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
