  m_text: "They're still not responding. It's been almost 4088 days. I can't\u2026
    I can't go to class today. I'll send a message to my teachers.\n\n\nWhat the
    356067 is happening?\n\n\nWhere could they have 134 gone?\n\n\n7139378, I feel
