  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "There's sOmething in the woods.\n\n\nThere's something there and I don't
    know what it is.\n\n\nI don't\u2026 What even was it? I couldn't catch even a
    small glimpse at it, but I swear it was there, iF only for a second.\n\n\nim
    going to be sick\n\n\nIt was watching me, the entire time I was there. It had
    to be. How else do you explain the eyes I could Feel on the back of my head the
    entire time? I didn't see eVen a single animal this time either. Did whatever
    that thiNg was do something to them?\n\n\nOh god, did it do sometHing to the
    others? Is that why I haven't been able to find mUch of anything?\n\n\nWhaT do
    I even do about something like that?\n\n\nI'm Just one person.\n\n\nI nEed to
    go back, see if I can find anything\u2014\u2014about the thing, about the others,
    anything. If I can find some kind of proof, then I can inVolve someone else.\n\n\nIt's
    late.\n\n\nI have to Quit doing this at night.\n\n\nI still feel watched.\n\n\nWhY
    do I still feel watched?\n\n\nI need to go to bed, I'm Just too wound up.\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
